The Internet-Drafts in this repository are IETF contributions.

Each draft carries `ipr: trust200902` in its front matter, placing it under the
IETF Trust Legal Provisions Relating to IETF Documents:

    https://trustee.ietf.org/documents/trust-legal-provisions/

In summary: these documents may be reproduced and distributed, and derivative
works and translations may be produced, provided the copyright notice and the
reference to the IETF Trust are preserved. Extracting code components is
permitted under the Simplified BSD License as set out in the Trust Legal
Provisions.

